  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3c640f2cfa727a24fbe19945d8a1f5b7, type: 3}
  journalLore: 'Where the trolls go, an old one goes with them: the trollkjerring, who brews in a pot under the hill and remembers every slight. The small trolls fear her more than they fear you.'
  journalAdvice: 'She hangs back behind the others, throwing stones, rallying them and calling rootlings out of the ground. Reach her first: without her the rest scatter.'
